# Local development secrets for `wrangler dev`.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill in values as needed.
# NEVER commit `.dev.vars`. Production secrets use `wrangler secret put`.
#
# Phase 0 requires no secrets. This file documents the mechanism only.

# Example (unused in Phase 0):
# EXAMPLE_SECRET=replace-me

# Phase 3 Unit 2 — salt for the click row's ip_hash / user_agent_hash (PRD §34).
# Optional: without it those columns stay NULL. Production: `wrangler secret put CLICK_SIGNAL_SALT`.
# CLICK_SIGNAL_SALT=replace-with-32-random-bytes
